# Project Refactoring Plan

## Goal
Simplify the project structure by consolidating all story episodes into a single directory (`01_ストーリー`), hiding system files that are not manually edited, and removing redundant "bridge" files to prevent confusion.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **File Deletion**: I propose deleting [EP04.6_EP04.7_Bridge.md](file:///c:/Users/hirak/Desktop/2nd-Brain/18_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E6%8A%95%E8%B3%87%E6%BC%AB%E7%94%BB/%E3%83%9E%E3%83%B3%E3%82%AC%E3%83%8E/01_%E9%95%B7%E7%B7%A8_%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E3%81%AE%E6%8A%95%E8%B3%87/%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E3%83%95%E3%82%A9%E3%83%AB%E3%83%80/EP04.6_EP04.7_Bridge.md) because it is simply a combination of `EP04.6` and `EP04.7`, which will both exist individually in the main folder.
> **Folder Deletion**: I will delete the `完成フォルダ` (Completed Folder) after moving its contents to `01_ストーリー`.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. System File Cleanup
Create a new folder `_System_Tools` and move the following files there to hide them from the main view:
- `完成フォルダ/read_file.py`
- `01_ストーリー/_update_themes.py`
- `完成フォルダ/00_新規生成リスト_ここからスタート.md` (If this is a template/instruction file)

### 2. Episode Consolidation
Move all episode files from `完成フォルダ` to `01_ストーリー` so the entire story (EP01 - EP23) is in one place.

**Files to Move:**
- `EP01_絶望の現実社会_P1-5.md`
- `EP02_搾取の連鎖_P6-10.md`
- `EP03_誘惑の囁き_P11-15.md`
- `EP04_救世主レミ_P16-20.md`
- `EP04.5_未来年表.md`
- `EP04.6_偏見の壁.md`

### 3. Redundancy Removal
**Delete:**
- `完成フォルダ/EP04.6_EP04.7_Bridge.md`
  - *Reasoning*: This file contains the text of EP04.6 and EP04.7. Since EP04.6 is being moved to `01_ストーリー` and EP04.7 already exists there, this combined file is redundant.

## Verification Plan
### Manual Verification
1.  **Check File List**: Run `list_dir` on `01_ストーリー` to ensure a continuous sequence of episodes (EP01, EP02, ... EP23).
2.  **Check Hidden Folder**: Confirm `_System_Tools` contains the scripts.
3.  **Content Check**: Quickly read `EP04.6_偏見の壁.md` and `EP04.7_入場資格.md` in the new location to ensure no data was lost from the bridge file deletion.
